### ===========================================================================
### PSA Sprint — Integration & Workflow Test Suite
### Complete HTTP test suite for PSAService endpoints, validations, and workflows.
### ===========================================================================

@host = http://localhost:4004
@adminAuth = Basic YWRtaW5AcHNhLmNvbTphZG1pbg==
@managerAuth = Basic bWFuYWdlckBwc2EuY29tOm1hbmFnZXI=
@employeeAuth = Basic ZW1wbG95ZWVAcHNhLmNvbTplbXBsb3llZQ==
@emp2Auth = Basic ZW1wMkBwc2EuY29tOmVtcGxveWVl

### ===========================================================================
### 1. Authentication & Identity Mapping (whoAmI)
### ===========================================================================

### 1.1 WhoAmI — Admin Profile
GET {{host}}/psa/whoAmI()
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 WhoAmI — Manager Profile
GET {{host}}/psa/whoAmI()
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 WhoAmI — Employee Profile
GET {{host}}/psa/whoAmI()
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Accept: application/json


### ===========================================================================
### 2. Role-Based Dashboard Functions
### ===========================================================================

### 2.1 Manager Dashboard KPIs (Scoped to Manager's Team/Projects)
GET {{host}}/psa/getManagerDashboard()
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Manager Project Portfolio (Table with Consumed Hours & Budget Burn)
GET {{host}}/psa/getProjectPortfolio()
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Admin Dashboard KPIs (Organization-Wide Metrics)
GET {{host}}/psa/getAdminDashboard()
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Employee Dashboard KPIs (Personal 4 Metrics)
GET {{host}}/psa/getEmployeeDashboard()
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.5 Employee My Projects (Assigned Projects Only)
GET {{host}}/psa/getMyProjects()
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Accept: application/json


### ===========================================================================
### 3. Timesheet Workflow (Draft -> Submit -> Approve / Reject -> Resubmit)
### ===========================================================================

### 3.1 Read Employee's Own Timesheets (Employee Scope)
GET {{host}}/psa/Timesheets?$filter=employee_ID eq 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111103&$expand=entries
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Create a New Draft Timesheet for Week 2026-10-26
POST {{host}}/psa/Timesheets
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-999999999901",
  "WEEK_START": "2026-10-26",
  "employee_ID": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111103"
}

### 3.3 Add Timesheet Entry (Work Date must fall within the week)
POST {{host}}/psa/TimesheetEntries
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": "66666666-6666-6666-6666-999999999901",
  "timesheet_ID": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-999999999901",
  "project_ID": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333301",
  "WORK_DATE": "2026-10-26",
  "HOURS": 8.00,
  "DESCRIPTION": "CAP service handler unit testing and validation"
}

### 3.4 Submit Timesheet for Manager Review
POST {{host}}/psa/submitTimesheet
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timesheetId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-999999999901"
}

### 3.5 Manager Approves the Submitted Timesheet
POST {{host}}/psa/approveTimesheet
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timesheetId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-999999999901"
}

### 3.6 Reject Timesheet with Mandatory Reason (Testing Rejection Flow)
POST {{host}}/psa/rejectTimesheet
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timesheetId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555505",
  "reason": "Please provide more details on task deliverables for Thursday."
}

### 3.7 Validation Check: Reject WITHOUT Reason — MUST FAIL (Mandatory Check)
POST {{host}}/psa/rejectTimesheet
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timesheetId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555505",
  "reason": ""
}

### 3.8 Security Check: Employee Attempting Self-Approval — MUST FAIL
POST {{host}}/psa/approveTimesheet
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timesheetId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555501"
}


### ===========================================================================
### 4. Entity CRUD Operations
### ===========================================================================

### 4.1 Clients — Read List
GET {{host}}/psa/Clients?$select=CLIENT_CODE,CLIENT_NAME,STATUS
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.2 Clients — Create New Client (Admin Authority)
POST {{host}}/psa/Clients
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CLIENT_CODE": "C099",
  "CLIENT_NAME": "Acme Innovations Ltd",
  "EMAIL": "info@acme.com",
  "PHONE": "+91-80-99887766",
  "CONTACT_PERSON": "Suresh Raina",
  "STATUS": "ACTIVE",
  "CITY": "Hyderabad",
  "COUNTRY": "India"
}

### 4.3 Employees — Read Directory
GET {{host}}/psa/Employees?$select=EMPLOYEE_CODE,FULL_NAME,ROLE,DEPARTMENT
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.4 Projects — Read with Associations
GET {{host}}/psa/Projects?$expand=client,manager,budgets
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.5 Budgets — Read Financial Budgets
GET {{host}}/psa/Budgets?$expand=project
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.6 Tasks — Read Open Tasks
GET {{host}}/psa/Tasks?$filter=STATUS eq 'OPEN'&$expand=assignedTo,project
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.7 Milestones — Read Milestones
GET {{host}}/psa/Milestones?$orderby=DUE_DATE asc
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.8 Invoices — Read Financial Invoices
GET {{host}}/psa/Invoices?$expand=client,project
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.9 Alerts — Read Active Alerts
GET {{host}}/psa/Alerts?$filter=IS_RESOLVED eq false&$orderby=SEVERITY desc
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Accept: application/json


### ===========================================================================
### 5. Access Control & Authorization Boundaries
### ===========================================================================

### 5.1 Employee Attempting to Access Admin Dashboard — MUST FAIL (403 Forbidden)
GET {{host}}/psa/getAdminDashboard()
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.2 Employee Attempting to Read Financial Budgets — MUST FAIL (403 Forbidden)
GET {{host}}/psa/Budgets
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.3 Employee Attempting to Create Project — MUST FAIL (403 Forbidden)
POST {{host}}/psa/Projects
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "PROJECT_CODE": "P999",
  "PROJECT_NAME": "Unauthorized Project Creation Attempt",
  "client_ID": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222201"
}


### ===========================================================================
### 6. Service Metadata & OData V4 Spec
### ===========================================================================

### 6.1 OData V4 Metadata Document
GET {{host}}/psa/$metadata
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}


### ===========================================================================
### 7. Invoice Lifecycle Workflow & Task Updates
### ===========================================================================

### 7.1 Admin Marks Invoice as Issued
POST {{host}}/psa/markInvoiceIssued
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777705"
}

### 7.2 Manager Attempting to Issue Invoice — MUST FAIL (403 Forbidden)
POST {{host}}/psa/markInvoiceIssued
Authorization: {{managerAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777705"
}

### 7.3 Admin Marks Issued Invoice as Paid
POST {{host}}/psa/markInvoicePaid
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "77777777-7777-7777-7777-777777777705",
  "paidAmount": 708000
}

### 7.4 Employee Updates Task Status on Assigned Task
PATCH {{host}}/psa/Tasks(55555555-0000-0000-0000-000000000002)
Authorization: {{employeeAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "STATUS": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "ACTUAL_HOURS": 50
}

